WEBVTT

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.150
-Take care.
-Yeah.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.960
Where am I?

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.260
Narumi!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.680
I see you've recovered.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.850
Come. Fou is calling for you.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.360
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.830
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:04.040
All I want is to be with those I love

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:10.170
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.090
I don't care anymore

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.970
I just don't know anymore

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.470
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.600
There are days when I think like that

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.480
But everything is precious to me

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.310
And so I fight on

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.820
Today was a tough day

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.860
I almost gave up hope

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:41.240
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.660
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:48.000
There are days when I think like that

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.630
But everything is precious to me

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.010
And so I must fight

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:11.110
#29 What Shirogane did

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.820
-Wait a minute...
-Shut up.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.280
Narumi.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:19.030
It's extremely rude of you
to not let Lady Francine get dressed.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.290
We will fight you this instant
if you are going to insult her.

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.410
Damn it. Hurry up.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:34.050
The people here are the only ones
in this world who can still move.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:40.050
The few children and adults we saved at
the ZONAPHA Syndrome Research Institute.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.560
And the doctors and nurses.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.470
I'm glad they found shelter.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.640
Thanks to old man Fou.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.770
The man who said I was
the reincarnation of Doll Francine.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.530
We're going to find out
if you really are or not.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.910
I am prepared.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.280
Narumi.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.490
-Is that her?
-Yeah.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.370
Let me know if she's one of the automata.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.830
I'll shoot her down.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.290
But...

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:15.210
Everyone here knows that
you hold the key to ZONAPHA.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:20.470
If you're not connected to Faceless,
Fou will prove it.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.760
But if we find that you're on his side,

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.350
when all is done...

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.940
I will kill you myself.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:36.610
Do not worry.
He'd be dead before he could touch you.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.360
Bring it on anytime.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.870
Mr. Masaru.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:49.910
Have I returned here
only to be hated by Narumi?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.710
-Shirogane!
-Shirogane!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.880
-You're back!
-We're so glad!

00:03:58.510 --> 00:03:59.510
You two...

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.800
-Phew.
-How have you been?

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.470
I'm so glad to see you all so well.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.470
You made it back in one piece.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.850
You too. How did you get here?

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.520
We were brought here from Kuroga
thanks to Mr. Fou.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.320
Shirogane, where's Masaru?

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.320
He went back for a puppet
that befriended us.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.780
He said not to worry, that he'll return.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.280
No...

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:27.910
I understand, but we must believe in him
and wait.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.040
You're right.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.290
Welcome back.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.290
Vilma!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.540
Ashihana?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.130
Hurry up.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.300
Yes. I'll see you later.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:50.640
What is this?
I feel somebody glaring at me.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.730
It's her.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:05:00.110
I feel a raging anger from her
like none other.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:09.330
To think I must look into your memory
on the first time we meet.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.700
-Forgive me.
-Of course.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:18.210
According to Faceless, you're the key
to stopping ZONAPHA.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.420
If you can't remember,
this is our only choice.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.470
-Forgive us.
-I understand.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.720
Thank you. Now, everything is ready.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.140
Would you like to watch?

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.970
I don't care about that woman's memory.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.730
Want me to force them out of here?

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:41.610
We are here to protect Lady Francine.
You will have to fight us.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:49.990
Your loyalty is what's putting Éléonore
in a bad spot, you know.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.910
It's okay, I have Olympia with me.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.910
I'll be outside then.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.670
Let us begin.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.430
You bore it well for 6 long hours.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.770
It's nothing compared to those
suffering with ZONAPHA.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:19.400
-You should get some rest.
-I will.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:24.490
But I wish there were
something I could do to help.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.500
Dinner is ready!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.290
I've brought your dinner.

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:45.380
We don't need anything from an automaton.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.970
But I didn't make it.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.390
Then leave it there and get out!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.560
Stay away from me, you automaton!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.940
I'm not an automaton.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.940
Then what are those puppets
that tag behind you?

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.070
I am Liang Mingxia.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.700
My father was killed by Pantalone.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.450
My arm, my body... All broken by puppets!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.330
Faceless disrupted the whole world
over you.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.120
It's all your fault!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.420
Now get out!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.800
I thought you'd dodge it.
You're not that nimble, huh.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.520
Forgive me.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.560
-Are you okay?
-Don't touch me.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.570
I'm the one who's going to fight
alongside Minghai.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.650
Not you.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.160
Can you hear me? Can you see me?

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:58.330
I can see you all very clearly.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.330
I have an Apollyon there
equipped with a camera.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.800
It's me, Faceless.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.090
Do you like my new face?
I made a younger clone of myself.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:15.600
To think we'd meet again,
but with me looking so handsome.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.640
I don't get what you're trying to do.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.850
Why did you save me in the Sahara?

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.650
Oh, that? Well.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.360
This is my last broadcast to you,
so I guess I'll tell you.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.320
I wanted to show off in front of you.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.900
Show off?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.490
Because you look just like him.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.370
My older brother who took Francine
away from me.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:46.880
I decided to make Éléonore mine
while you watched on.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.170
So I set out to do just that.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:53.130
I pretended to die and left the Sahara.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:58.510
But before I left,
I let the puppets know who I was.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.770
That I was their creator.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:07.520
The puppets that had mistaken me
for a shirogane all kneeled before me.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:13.070
Faceless of the three solutions.
The last one is "disclose."

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:19.580
Now then, let me tell you why
I've contacted you in this way.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.080
I couldn't make Éléonore mine after all.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:29.340
So, what does a man
who's had his heart broken do?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.840
Some repent.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:36.180
Some try to forget. Some find a new love.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.850
But not me. Nope.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.850
I got tired of all this crap.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:51.440
I hate this world now.
So I'm going to get rid of it.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:54.990
Don't touch me!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.990
I just wanted to change your bandages...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:05.460
-Yeah right.
-You make my gut turn just seeing you.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.670
Get out of our sight.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.080
Hey, stop that!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.920
-Saying everything's her fault!
-Because it is!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.880
Don't just shove her like that!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.970
-No, it's okay.
-Shirogane.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.550
I'm sorry.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.260
Please, let me help you again later.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.610
Thanks.

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:34.320
But why are you doing all this for me?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.530
I wonder why.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.080
But I can relax when I'm with you.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.160
Cuz we're both assassins, eh?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.010
Is the breeze too cool?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.180
You're worrying about me? Thanks.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.640
Of course.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.600
It feels nice.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:12.690
The others can't go out because of
ZONAPHA, but we can thanks to Aqua Vitae.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.570
Hey, take it easy.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.700
My strength has been returning recently.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:23.450
The children and the adults
are all growing healthier, too.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.990
Yeah.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.960
About Éléonore...

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.500
I threw a pitcher at her.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.550
I thought she'd dodge it.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.300
But she didn't.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.350
I can't forgive her.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.350
The puppets that killed my father
are so loyal to her.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.060
I'll avenge your father.

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.480
I won't accept the reincarnation
of some automaton.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.860
Yeah.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.360
You're right.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.740
Shirogane?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.000
What's wrong?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.460
I wanted to help the people
who are suffering.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.880
But I seem to be torturing them even more.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.760
I think they're just scared.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:22.300
Scared?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:28.180
They're the only ones in the world now
who can move, but they can't do anything.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.100
This reality weighs heavily on them,
and it's scary.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.730
So they're taking it out on you.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.030
I see.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.780
I've felt that way before, too.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.620
Locked up in a small room,
scared of the people outside.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.580
What do you do in times like that?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.290
Me? Well...

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.330
I sing.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:13:00.960
I sing a song,
and it helps me forget all my troubles.

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:09.140
I'd forgotten that I was an entertainer.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:12.940
An entertainer must strive
to make the audience happy.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:14.850
Hey.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.440
Fou's calling for you all.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:24.030
A few days ago,
Faceless sent us a final broadcast.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.740
Take a look.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:33.500
I've ordered every Apollyon to accelerate
the progression of ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:40.500
Everyone on Earth with ZONAPHA
will die within the next 2 weeks.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.260
Oh, and tell Éléonore.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.890
That she should've chosen me.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:03.110
Women shouldn't be held responsible
for the actions of broken-hearted men.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.490
Am I right?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:10.160
The enemy is in a space station
480 km above Earth's surface.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:15.250
All the military satellites are now
also controlled by Faceless.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.840
And even if we do succeed in killing him,

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:23.420
the Apollyon bugs
won't stop carrying out his orders.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.840
They'll keep working until
all mankind is dead.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:30.640
We only have one choice left.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:35.600
To go meet Faceless and get him to tell us
how to stop the Apollyons.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.900
That's impossible.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.230
Then I guess mankind will die out.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.860
But there is one way to do it.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:50.820
And to do it, we need the help
of the Nakamachi Circus.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.370
Huh?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.580
Harry was developed
to destroy ZONAPHA bugs.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:02.630
It was modified once to emit waves
rather than treat humans one at a time.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:10.300
ZONAPHA bugs couldn't get any closer
to Harry than 8 meters.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.970
And so I thought.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.640
Why not attach Harry to a space shuttle?

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:22.560
We'll take the shuttle to a launch pad
and connect it to a rocket.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:26.150
And send it up to the space station
where Faceless is.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:31.240
I've converted an old steam locomotive
to use to transport it.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:35.700
ZONAPHA bugs can't disrupt
such old machinery.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.910
Narumi will ride in it.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.170
-Will you do it?
-Sure.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:46.510
And I want you to protect Narumi
and the space shuttle.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:50.630
Why are you asking a circus to do it?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.180
Yeah, we might be hurt
but we can do the job.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.640
No, you can't.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:59.980
You'd get ZONAPHA before reaching
the launch pad.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.400
Isn't that the same for the circus?

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.690
They spent a lot of time with Éléonore.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:12.490
Shirogane's blood is Aqua Vitae,
the elixir of life.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:17.830
It's always around her, in her breath,
in her sweat.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.960
So we'd been breathing it in
just by being with her.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.460
So where is the launch pad?

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.880
10,000 km away
on the Trans-Siberian Railway.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:33.140
The Bodny Cosmodrome
on the eastern edge of Russia.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.760
That far?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.770
The closer ones
are all under Faceless's control now.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.270
How about it? Will you do it for us?

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:43.810
I'll do it.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.480
It's too dangerous, so please stay here.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.650
Shirogane.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.650
I oppose.
Éléonore shouldn't be a part of this.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.200
Same here.
I can protect Minghai by myself.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.370
I'm going.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.990
-Me too.
-Count me in.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.000
Hey, everybody calm down.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:05.080
Why don't you all watch Éléonore's memory?

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.250
Then you can decide for yourself.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.210
I will leave the room.

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:11.630
Thank you.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:15.180
Ridiculous. I'm not watching.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.260
We'll watch.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:29.320
I couldn't care less about your memory.
I'm going. That's that.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.700
I will protect you and the shuttle
with my life.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.450
Have it your way.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:48.210
You've said you don't know me
ever since we reunited.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.670
But we've met before.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.340
Have you truly forgotten me?

00:17:55.840 --> 00:18:00.390
And Mr. Masaru, too?

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:04.270
Remember that joke you said to me?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.980
You're going to be my girl.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:11.480
Shut up! I would never say that.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.900
Stop acting so humanlike,
you automaton remake.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.490
You give me the creeps.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.290
You may detest me
from the bottom of your heart.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.620
I do not mind.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.500
Because of what I've felt for you
ever since that day.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.420
I am your Shirogane.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.990
Wait.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.030
What is it?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.540
I want to show you something.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.290
What is this place?

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:14.800
The water treatment facility.
All our water is sent from here.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.050
So what?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.680
Look inside, but be quiet.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.230
Why is she here?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.690
Is she poisoning it?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.000
She's pouring her blood, an elixir,
into the drinking water.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.260
No... I don't believe it.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:02.340
I tried stopping her.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:07.100
She may be a shirogane,
but too much blood loss could kill her.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.680
But she wouldn't stop.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.770
She does this every day?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.570
Ever since she woke up here.

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:18.780
That day...

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.360
She didn't get hit on purpose.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.570
She was too weak to dodge it.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.950
Is it thanks to her
that everyone is getting healthier?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.250
She knew.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:35.750
That Faceless is destroying the world
because of her.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.840
That everyone had a right to hate her.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:44.340
This was the only way
she could think of to make amends.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:51.180
You knew something too.
About ZONAPHA and your father.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.730
That it wasn't Éléonore's fault.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:04.360
My darling child

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:09.370
My beloved child

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:14.670
Just like the leaves

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:18.800
That dance in the wind

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:24.800
Your little bed

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.390
Sways to and fro

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:34.390
Heavenly Father

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:38.940
In thy kingdom above

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:44.400
Give one to this child

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:49.660
And one to each of us

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:54.660
Someday, please

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:59.000
Bestow your blessing

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:06.890
Upon us all

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:25.240
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:30.030
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:34.700
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:39.630
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:44.340
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:48.970
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.140 --> 00:22:53.770
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:58.770
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:03.440
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:08.030
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.660
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:12.830 --> 00:23:17.410
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.630
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:30.430
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:34.890
The melody that brought you here
